[244.195573, "o", "Job 0 Op 2: M0 [11-16] (was M0 [24-29]) - MC:False, shift:13\r\nJob 1 Op 1: M1 [20-26] (was M1 [9-15]) - MC:False, shift:11\r\nJob 1 Op 2: M0 [26-33] (was M0 [29-36]) - MC:False, shift:3\r\nJob 2 Op 0: M1 [26-30] (was M1 [5-9]) - MC:False, shift:21\r\nJob 2 Op 1: M0 [33-41] (was M0 [16-24]) - MC:False, shift:17\r\nJob 2 Op 2: M2 [41-46] (was M2 [11-16]) - MC:False, shift:30\r\nJob 3 Op 1: M1 [30-35] (was M1 [15-20]) - MC:False, shift:15\r\nJob 3 Op 2: M2 [46-52] (was M2 [20-26]) - MC:False, shift:26\r\n\r\nMakespan: 52 (max: 39)\r\nMachine changes: 0 (max: 4)\r\nTotal start shift: 136 (max: 120)\r\nDowntime violations: 0\r\n\r\nNeed better strategy...\r\n"]
